	(text "Samtec SSW-140-01-G-D socket mates the TSW-140-07-G-D header on CTRL (both catalogs list the pair;\nTSW -07 post 5.84 mm inside SSW insertion depth 3.68-6.35 mm). 4.7 A/pin: +24V and +24V_GD 2 pins each.\nNo I2C pull-ups here (CTRL has them). Pull-ups / pull-downs sit next to each driver on its sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 143.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "275cca77-03fe-54fd-bc39-81f082f07b9d")
	)
